# Files `cap sync` must never copy into a native build.
#
# Belt and braces. capacitor.config.ts points `webDir` at native-shell/ (one
# small page), so nothing here should ever be in reach — but the app this
# project's engineering was adapted from pointed `webDir` at `public/`
# with no ignore file and shipped a 239 MB audio folder inside every native
# build for months. If `webDir` is ever changed, these keep the weight out.
# scripts/check-native-bundle.mjs fails the build if either layer is missing.
#
# Patterns are relative to `webDir`. `name/` is a directory anywhere;
# `*.ext` is an extension; a bare name is a file or directory of that name.

# Content is data served from storage, never part of the app (CLAUDE.md).
content/
books/
photos/
audio/
voice/
narration/
site/

# Media by extension, wherever it sits.
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
*.ogg
*.opus
*.aac
*.flac
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
